# Normalise every text file to LF in the index and in the working tree. Byte-stable
# checkouts are what make `git diff --exit-code NOTICE` and the generated-schema
# staleness check in CI meaningful on both Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixture and asset binaries: never diffed, never renormalised.
